75.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-05T11:19:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134687506,imgsize-68870.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SC issues notice to Centre over Central Vista library plan, seeks reply in 3 weeks]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-issues-notice-to-centre-over-central-vista-library-plan-seeks-reply-in-3-weeks/articleshow/134687184.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134687184.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Supreme Court has urged the Centre to submit a comprehensive report regarding library facilities. The inquiry centers on the designated space for the current book collection within the Central Vista project framework. Since 2011, around two lakh books have been stored without being unpacked, prompting worries from court officials.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-issues-notice-to-centre-over-central-vista-library-plan-seeks-reply-in-3-weeks/articleshow/134687184.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-issues-notice-to-centre-over-central-vista-library-plan-seeks-reply-in-3-weeks/articleshow/134687184.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-05T11:00:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134687203,imgsize-112480.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Delhi riots: HC rejects pleas seeking FIR against political leaders over 'hate speeches']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/2020-delhi-riots-delhi-hc-dismisses-pleas-seeking-against-sonia-gandhi-anurag-thakur-over-hate-speech/articleshow/134686882.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="1